WEBVTT

00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:01.376
"Student Council Office"

00:00:01.376 --> 00:00:03.962
"Student Council Office"
So while we're on this topic,

00:00:03.962 --> 00:00:04.129
So while we're on this topic,

00:00:04.338 --> 00:00:08.091
after checking the condition
of older desks and chairs,

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.928
we'll see if they are worth replacing
and plan a budget...

00:00:12.137 --> 00:00:13.347
What's the matter, Kageyama?

00:00:13.555 --> 00:00:15.891
Are you not feeling well?

00:00:29.988 --> 00:00:30.155
"Student Council"

00:00:30.155 --> 00:00:32.866
"Student Council" I-I'm sorry...
I... I have to leave early today!

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:33.325
I-I'm sorry... I... I have
to leave early today!

00:00:33.534 --> 00:00:35.160
Hey, Kageyama!

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:39.748
Nii-san! Wait, could this be from
the shock of getting rejected...?

00:00:39.957 --> 00:00:40.999
I'm sorry.

00:00:41.208 --> 00:00:43.752
I actually like someone else.

00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:54.137
Wait for me, Nii-san! I'll be right there!

00:01:08.986 --> 00:01:10.529
This is Nii-san's.

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:17.494
Wait...

00:01:17.703 --> 00:01:19.580
Was he in an accident?

00:01:24.334 --> 00:01:29.840
MOB MOB WOW! MOB MOB WOW!

00:01:30.048 --> 00:01:34.928
MOB MOB WOW! MOB MOB WOW!

00:01:35.971 --> 00:01:38.473
I realized that my youth was grey

00:01:38.682 --> 00:01:41.435
The root of this irritation is unknown

00:01:41.643 --> 00:01:43.937
My brain runs parallel with this emotional train

00:01:44.146 --> 00:01:47.149
Struggling adolescence

00:01:47.357 --> 00:01:49.985
Don't disturb the subconscious mind

00:01:50.193 --> 00:01:52.821
Who's that behind me?

00:01:53.030 --> 00:01:56.450
Opposing ideas, distortion

00:01:56.658 --> 00:02:00.078
Purge the sorrow

00:02:00.287 --> 00:02:03.624
So, do what you can now.

00:02:03.832 --> 00:02:05.751
My life

00:02:05.959 --> 00:02:06.793
Finally

00:02:07.002 --> 00:02:11.048
Break it down!!

00:02:11.256 --> 00:02:13.967
(WANT) desire (YOUNG) and sincerity

00:02:14.176 --> 00:02:16.762
(BURN) they begin to sprout (1) within my chest

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:19.556
(TRANCE) I won't awaken (CHANCE) but I want to

00:02:19.765 --> 00:02:22.517
(STANCE) both sides of the coin
(1) are back-to-back

00:02:22.726 --> 00:02:25.312
Accept me as I am

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:28.523
Conflicting freedom and relations

00:02:28.732 --> 00:02:30.692
If they can become one

00:02:30.901 --> 00:02:32.319
That smile will be

00:02:32.527 --> 00:02:34.154
One and only "1"

00:02:34.363 --> 00:02:39.743
MOB MOB WOW! MOB MOB WOW!

00:02:39.868 --> 00:02:39.951
"Mob Psycho 100 III"

00:02:39.951 --> 00:02:40.952
"Mob Psycho 100 III"
MOB MOB WOW!

00:02:40.952 --> 00:02:41.161
"Mob Psycho 100 III"

00:02:41.161 --> 00:02:42.621
"Mob Psycho 100 III"
One and only "1"

00:02:42.621 --> 00:02:42.829
"Mob Psycho 100 III"

00:02:42.829 --> 00:02:45.749
"Mob Psycho 100 "
MOB MOB WOW! MOB MOB WOW!

00:02:45.749 --> 00:02:46.583
MOB MOB WOW! MOB MOB WOW!

00:02:46.792 --> 00:02:49.711
One and only "1"

00:02:51.046 --> 00:02:55.550
"Mob 3
~Trauma~"

00:03:05.769 --> 00:03:07.270
The shop...

00:03:08.980 --> 00:03:12.776
I'm so sorry, Manager!

00:03:14.444 --> 00:03:18.073
Damn it. I guess we aren't
enough to stop him after all.

00:03:20.909 --> 00:03:21.493
What the--?!

00:03:21.702 --> 00:03:23.745
Now there's an explosion behind us?

00:03:28.041 --> 00:03:30.377
Wait, seriously?

00:03:30.585 --> 00:03:33.505
Wh-What are you doing here...

00:03:33.714 --> 00:03:35.298
--...Boss?
--Boss!

00:03:36.591 --> 00:03:40.762
Well, well... It looks like you two
are making an honest living now.

00:03:40.971 --> 00:03:44.141
Leave the rest to me.

00:03:46.685 --> 00:03:48.562
I've come to repay my debt.

00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:51.815
Sorry, but this will probably hurt a little.

00:04:28.268 --> 00:04:30.479
I thought you might be in a bad mood,

00:04:30.687 --> 00:04:32.773
but you actually seem rather well.

00:04:32.981 --> 00:04:35.734
Or rather, you seem like
you've been liberated.

00:04:35.942 --> 00:04:38.487
I guess you've given up on holding back.

00:04:38.695 --> 00:04:42.032
That in itself isn't a bad thing,

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:44.743
but are you really the same person?

00:04:53.293 --> 00:04:57.422
To think there'd be this
much of a difference...

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:03.553
Man, that was close.

00:05:03.762 --> 00:05:06.223
Don't get your ass kicked
so easily, old man!

00:05:06.431 --> 00:05:08.266
You could've died!

00:05:08.475 --> 00:05:12.145
Sho... What are you doing here?

00:05:12.354 --> 00:05:16.191
I'm helping my good-for-nothing dad
do some good for society.

00:05:16.399 --> 00:05:19.569
I am your son, after all.

00:05:19.778 --> 00:05:23.031
Huh? Wait, that's...

00:05:23.240 --> 00:05:25.158
It's Kageyama Shigeo.

00:05:25.367 --> 00:05:27.244
He's lost control of his powers,

00:05:27.452 --> 00:05:31.039
and something has been
unleashed from within him.

00:05:31.248 --> 00:05:36.002
Seriously? I don't know how I feel
about fighting Ritsu's bro.

00:05:36.211 --> 00:05:41.258
But being gentle won't do
any good in this situation.

00:05:41.466 --> 00:05:44.594
Can't say I've actually
ever seen you be gentle.

00:05:49.182 --> 00:05:50.517
A direct hit?!

00:05:51.393 --> 00:05:53.812
Dad! Hey, you okay?

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:55.647
Calm down.

00:05:59.359 --> 00:06:05.782
I just needed to borrow some of his powers
to make up for the massive gap.

00:06:05.991 --> 00:06:07.951
So you got hit on purpose?

00:06:08.159 --> 00:06:10.287
This fight has only just begun.

00:06:10.495 --> 00:06:11.913
Are you going to help me, Sho?

00:06:12.122 --> 00:06:13.540
You got a plan?

00:06:13.748 --> 00:06:20.088
If he continues to unleash energy at that rate,
he will eventually run out of stamina.

00:06:20.297 --> 00:06:23.300
We just need to buy some
time until he stops.

00:06:23.508 --> 00:06:25.635
So we're trying to get
him to run outta gas.

00:06:25.844 --> 00:06:27.178
Got it.

00:06:32.267 --> 00:06:33.768
Nii-san.

00:06:33.977 --> 00:06:38.857
Ever since that incident, we've stopped
speaking our minds with each other.

00:06:39.774 --> 00:06:44.321
Feeling responsible changed my brother.

00:06:44.529 --> 00:06:47.324
He used to get mad and laugh...

00:06:47.532 --> 00:06:51.786
When we were little,
he would let his emotions show.

00:06:51.995 --> 00:06:55.832
But then, he stopped willingly
showing his powers.

00:06:58.251 --> 00:07:05.300
This version of him was created from
being suppressed and locked away.

00:07:05.508 --> 00:07:10.513
They're connected deep down
and cannot be separated.

00:07:10.722 --> 00:07:14.517
We have to continue living
with him from now on, too.

00:07:21.441 --> 00:07:22.901
Teru-san?!

00:07:24.277 --> 00:07:25.570
Follow my lead.

00:07:25.779 --> 00:07:27.447
I know!

00:07:51.054 --> 00:07:52.222
Have a nice flight!

00:07:52.430 --> 00:07:54.975
Charge Bomb!

00:08:12.575 --> 00:08:13.743
Seriously?

00:08:13.952 --> 00:08:15.829
So that's his play.

00:08:16.037 --> 00:08:20.959
Wait, wait, wait.
He just sucked up everything we had.

00:08:21.793 --> 00:08:23.086
Damn it!

00:08:35.974 --> 00:08:38.810
The hell do you think you're doing?

00:08:39.644 --> 00:08:41.813
H-Hey...

00:08:42.022 --> 00:08:45.734
We can't even buy some time?

00:08:45.942 --> 00:08:49.154
This is beyond us!
Let's get the hell outta here!

00:08:49.362 --> 00:08:50.488
It's futile.

00:08:50.697 --> 00:08:53.533
I'm not going to be able to escape,
wounded like this.

00:09:05.587 --> 00:09:08.882
Something's wrong.
What the hell's going on?

00:09:10.508 --> 00:09:13.303
He's... struggling?

00:09:13.511 --> 00:09:17.432
Is he... fighting back inside?

00:09:17.640 --> 00:09:20.643
I guess Ritsu's bro is still fighting...

00:09:20.852 --> 00:09:23.855
...against his out-of-control powers.

00:09:25.065 --> 00:09:28.193
You really are strong.

00:09:29.944 --> 00:09:32.655
This is our best chance.

00:09:32.864 --> 00:09:35.492
Sho, you need to run away.

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:37.869
What?! What about you?

00:09:38.078 --> 00:09:42.248
There's one way to stop him.

00:09:42.457 --> 00:09:46.336
I will become a vessel
and absorb all of his energy.

00:09:46.544 --> 00:09:49.339
I just need to do what he did for me last time.

00:09:49.547 --> 00:09:51.132
That again?

00:09:51.341 --> 00:09:54.135
That's insane. You're going to break.

00:09:54.344 --> 00:09:57.138
That's fine. If I sacrifice myself--

00:09:57.347 --> 00:09:58.556
The hell are you talking--

00:09:58.765 --> 00:10:00.850
I'm prepared for this.

00:10:20.328 --> 00:10:21.663
Dad.

00:10:50.984 --> 00:10:52.902
I'm sorry.

00:10:53.111 --> 00:10:57.657
It seems I can't be as strong as you are.

00:10:59.450 --> 00:11:03.079
Sho, will you lend me your shoulder?

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:05.832
Let's flee.

00:11:16.259 --> 00:11:20.847
This is worse than we thought.
Even Suzuki couldn't get the job done.

00:11:21.055 --> 00:11:22.182
Let's go grab him.

00:11:22.390 --> 00:11:23.224
Yes, sir.

00:11:23.433 --> 00:11:25.476
Dropping the guide drones.

00:11:29.189 --> 00:11:31.774
Psychic powers are terrifying.

00:11:31.983 --> 00:11:36.988
I guess he already knew
that this power was taboo.

00:11:37.197 --> 00:11:42.452
Yeah, I know. I won't use mine anymore.

00:11:42.660 --> 00:11:46.831
Living normally is the most
important thing, right?

00:11:47.040 --> 00:11:51.669
It's difficult... But that's what
he's done this whole time.

00:11:55.423 --> 00:11:59.385
What's going to happen to that guy now?

00:11:59.594 --> 00:12:02.972
No one will be able to stop him.

00:12:07.018 --> 00:12:10.855
You've gone way too far, Nii-san...

00:12:19.906 --> 00:12:23.201
Kageyama!

00:12:23.409 --> 00:12:26.371
So you are still here.

00:12:26.579 --> 00:12:27.622
We're here to help you!

00:12:27.830 --> 00:12:30.291
Let's take shelter at the gym together!

00:12:32.335 --> 00:12:34.587
That is Kageyama... right?

00:12:34.796 --> 00:12:37.006
Answer us, damn it!

00:12:46.307 --> 00:12:50.311
That was no ordinary gust of wind, was it?

00:12:50.520 --> 00:12:56.067
I believe that Kageyama must be in
some kind of sleepwalking state.

00:12:56.276 --> 00:12:58.194
Yeah, I think so.

00:12:58.403 --> 00:13:00.405
Which means...

00:13:02.407 --> 00:13:05.785
We definitely can't leave him alone.

00:13:05.994 --> 00:13:07.787
Body Improvement...

00:13:07.996 --> 00:13:10.665
Fight on!

00:13:14.502 --> 00:13:16.504
He just brushed us off like flies...

00:13:16.713 --> 00:13:19.465
Does this mean that Kageyama-kun...

00:13:19.674 --> 00:13:22.302
...was this powerful without us
even realizing it?

00:13:22.510 --> 00:13:29.142
But, you know... we always look up to
how you usually are, too, Kageyama-kun.

00:13:29.350 --> 00:13:32.687
So could you consider going back to normal?

00:13:33.604 --> 00:13:35.106
Stop!

00:13:42.030 --> 00:13:43.656
This is dangerous.

00:13:45.783 --> 00:13:48.202
So you really are in that state.

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:52.665
It's been a while.

00:13:52.874 --> 00:13:54.375
Nii-san.

00:13:55.710 --> 00:13:59.797
I've always been terrified
about this happening.

00:14:00.006 --> 00:14:02.842
I've been cowering all this time,

00:14:03.051 --> 00:14:06.763
wondering when that alternate version
of you would appear again.

00:14:08.181 --> 00:14:09.932
I hate it.

00:14:10.141 --> 00:14:15.063
But I'm not scared anymore.
I finally figured it out.

00:14:15.271 --> 00:14:18.024
This isn't a separate, scary version of you.

00:14:18.232 --> 00:14:21.444
It's a part of you.

00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:24.238
So there's no reason to be scared.

00:14:24.447 --> 00:14:27.784
There's no reason to tremble
at the sight of it.

00:14:27.992 --> 00:14:29.911
Because I'm...

00:14:30.119 --> 00:14:31.996
...your younger brother.

00:14:33.289 --> 00:14:36.959
No, Ritsu. You're wrong!

00:14:37.168 --> 00:14:39.212
That's not me!

00:14:42.632 --> 00:14:45.802
Ritsu, you need to...

00:14:46.010 --> 00:14:50.681
...get away from that thing!

00:14:52.892 --> 00:14:54.268
Nii-san.

00:14:54.477 --> 00:14:57.313
You don't need to suffer alone like this.

00:14:58.898 --> 00:15:00.608
Is something wrong?

00:15:00.817 --> 00:15:03.152
I'll be happy to listen
if something's bothering you.

00:15:04.570 --> 00:15:08.032
Nope, I'm fine! Thanks, though.

00:15:08.950 --> 00:15:12.912
The truth was... I wanted us to talk it out.

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:16.666
But looking back on it now...

00:15:16.874 --> 00:15:21.712
... guess you were holding something in
that you couldn't tell me...

00:15:21.921 --> 00:15:25.007
...by putting a lid on your powers.

00:15:26.926 --> 00:15:28.719
I don't want to hurt him.

00:15:28.928 --> 00:15:31.264
At this rate, the same thing will...

00:15:31.472 --> 00:15:36.102
But I don't want you to
change anymore, Nii-san.

00:15:36.310 --> 00:15:38.646
Don't try to bear this on your own.

00:15:38.855 --> 00:15:41.190
I'm here for you!

00:15:41.399 --> 00:15:44.152
I can't hold him any longer!

00:15:49.282 --> 00:15:54.162
I can't move! My powers don't
stand a chance against him!

00:15:55.830 --> 00:16:00.668
Are you telling me that there's
nothing I can do for Nii-san...?

00:16:00.877 --> 00:16:05.381
Please, stop... You're my powers, right?

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:11.429
That's enough! Listen to me!

00:16:15.558 --> 00:16:19.604
It's not stopping... Ritsu's in danger.

00:16:19.812 --> 00:16:21.439
If this continues...

00:16:21.647 --> 00:16:23.900
If he ends up hurting Takane-san, too...

00:16:24.108 --> 00:16:26.777
...he won't be able to bear it.

00:16:27.737 --> 00:16:29.655
Then I'll just have to...

00:16:32.241 --> 00:16:33.868
That's it.

00:16:34.076 --> 00:16:37.121
I'm sure that some shock
will cause a change.

00:16:38.748 --> 00:16:41.542
I'm sorry, Nii-san.

00:16:49.675 --> 00:16:51.093
No!

00:16:51.302 --> 00:16:53.513
He shouldn't be held down by trauma!!

00:16:55.056 --> 00:16:58.809
The thing I can do for you, Nii-san...

00:17:02.813 --> 00:17:08.569
...is continue being the little brother
you can talk to at any time.

00:17:09.445 --> 00:17:12.740
It's to become the little brother
you can speak your mind with!

00:17:12.740 --> 00:17:13.157
"Ritsu" It's to become the little
brother you can speak your mind with!

00:17:13.157 --> 00:17:13.699
"Ritsu"

00:17:20.706 --> 00:17:23.000
I finally figured it out.

00:17:24.502 --> 00:17:27.296
The reason I wanted powers...

00:17:27.505 --> 00:17:29.632
...was for this moment!

00:17:31.551 --> 00:17:35.012
You'll be okay now, Nii-san.

00:17:58.911 --> 00:18:02.540
No! Stop!

00:18:14.218 --> 00:18:14.468
"Breaking News"
"A Giant Twister Emerges in Seasoning City"

00:18:14.468 --> 00:18:16.178
"Breaking News" "A Giant Twister Emerges in Seasoning City"
A giant tornado has now appeared inside Seasoning City.

00:18:16.178 --> 00:18:19.348
A giant tornado has now appeared
inside Seasoning City.

00:18:19.557 --> 00:18:24.312
It continues to slowly move
along, surging eerily.

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:26.272
Why are these things occurring
in the same region,

00:18:26.480 --> 00:18:30.610
and why are they happening
one after another?

00:18:30.818 --> 00:18:32.612
According to some experts,

00:18:32.820 --> 00:18:36.824
there are theories that this is the result
of some top secret science project,

00:18:37.033 --> 00:18:41.704
and some suspect that this
is the work of psychics.

00:18:41.912 --> 00:18:44.624
According to the emergency press
conference held by the government,

00:18:44.832 --> 00:18:49.420
no government agencies
are involved with these--

00:18:52.423 --> 00:18:55.885
There's no entry beyond this point.
You can't come in.

00:18:56.093 --> 00:18:56.886
H-Hey!

00:18:57.094 --> 00:18:58.679
Hold it!

00:19:06.729 --> 00:19:10.733
I guess that was about all I could do...

00:19:11.651 --> 00:19:15.071
Come back to us, Nii-san...

00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:22.787
Found you.

00:19:25.456 --> 00:19:29.669
What are you? Why are you doing this?

00:19:34.215 --> 00:19:38.052
I am me. I'm Kageyama Shigeo.

00:19:38.260 --> 00:19:40.179
Who are you supposed to be?

00:19:40.388 --> 00:19:44.225
Huh? I'm Kageyama Shigeo...

00:19:44.433 --> 00:19:46.769
Ah, so you're "Mob."

00:19:46.977 --> 00:19:48.729
The fake me.

00:19:48.938 --> 00:19:50.856
You're the fake one here.

00:19:51.065 --> 00:19:53.818
I don't need these powers anymore.

00:19:54.026 --> 00:19:55.861
I need you to disappear from within me.

00:19:56.070 --> 00:20:00.366
Then you should just disappear.
I will live freely.

00:20:00.574 --> 00:20:02.118
I will stop you.

00:20:02.326 --> 00:20:04.870
No one can stop me.

00:20:12.128 --> 00:20:14.922
Is it just me, or do you feel sluggish, too?

00:20:15.131 --> 00:20:18.926
It might be dangerous to go any farther.

00:20:19.135 --> 00:20:22.513
But Mob's in the center
of that tornado, right?

00:20:22.722 --> 00:20:23.639
Probably...

00:20:23.848 --> 00:20:27.852
But I'm not sure if we'll make it out
in one piece even if we get there...

00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:32.022
You just need to help me get there. Please.

00:20:34.483 --> 00:20:38.112
All right. I'll do everything that I can.

00:20:40.656 --> 00:20:42.867
All right, let's go!

00:20:44.910 --> 00:20:47.246
Why are you doing this?

00:20:47.455 --> 00:20:50.791
Do you remember being hit by a car?

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:53.711
I couldn't move anymore
with just my body alone.

00:20:55.254 --> 00:20:58.007
That's why I had to move
through sheer will.

00:20:58.215 --> 00:21:01.927
What are you talking about?
This isn't my will at all.

00:21:02.136 --> 00:21:06.223
You have a very strong desire
to go see Tsubomi-chan.

00:21:06.432 --> 00:21:10.519
That is the most important thing to me.

00:21:11.729 --> 00:21:13.439
But that's...

00:21:13.647 --> 00:21:16.901
That's not something you should be
doing at the cost of harming others.

00:21:17.109 --> 00:21:19.987
This isn't normal.

00:21:20.196 --> 00:21:27.787
What is normal? Are you trying
to invalidate me once again?

00:21:27.995 --> 00:21:33.751
If you just break and disappear,
I won't have to hold back anymore.

00:21:34.668 --> 00:21:37.505
I'm going to do what I want.

00:21:43.969 --> 00:21:46.639
The next time you wake up...

00:21:46.847 --> 00:21:49.308
...I will be me.

00:21:50.976 --> 00:21:54.063
Goodbye, Mob.

00:21:55.397 --> 00:21:57.608
There was a blue light shining

00:21:57.817 --> 00:22:00.069
I'm wide awake this 1:30 AM

00:22:00.277 --> 00:22:02.696
What remained even after I swiped

00:22:02.905 --> 00:22:06.534
Are the smiles of my friends right beside me

00:22:15.543 --> 00:22:17.753
Yes, I want someone to understand...

00:22:17.962 --> 00:22:20.297
This wish that's hidden colorless and invisible

00:22:20.506 --> 00:22:22.842
The breath I was holding deep within my heart

00:22:23.050 --> 00:22:25.511
I let it all out at once and return to my senses

00:22:25.719 --> 00:22:27.888
On days that I'm feeling apathetic
it suddenly comes to mind

00:22:28.097 --> 00:22:30.432
These seasons I spent as if they were a given

00:22:30.641 --> 00:22:32.935
Even if reality becomes sullied

00:22:33.143 --> 00:22:36.188
Only the sky we saw together is real

00:22:36.397 --> 00:22:38.315
This is more incomprehensible

00:22:38.524 --> 00:22:40.568
Than the grammar on the blackboard

00:22:40.776 --> 00:22:42.987
If it's going to disappear within 24 hours

00:22:43.195 --> 00:22:45.865
This flowing story is just too lonely

00:22:46.073 --> 00:22:47.783
I just can't do it

00:22:47.992 --> 00:22:49.994
Just like that back hip circle I gave up on

00:22:50.202 --> 00:22:52.496
But I'm not going to...

00:22:52.705 --> 00:22:54.039
Give up

00:22:54.248 --> 00:22:55.833
My present anymore

00:22:56.041 --> 00:22:58.252
I adorn my overflowing emotions

00:22:58.460 --> 00:23:00.796
And run through my worries and hesitations

00:23:01.005 --> 00:23:03.299
It can't be decided from 0 to 100

00:23:03.507 --> 00:23:05.843
Draw the incomplete future with this hand

00:23:06.051 --> 00:23:08.304
We can't even prove its existence

00:23:08.512 --> 00:23:11.473
But as the world stabs the middle of my chest

00:23:11.682 --> 00:23:14.810
It overflows with cobalt blue

00:23:23.360 --> 00:23:25.112
English Translator: Michelle Tymon Translation Editor:
Zachary Carlysle Translation Checker: Sriram Gurunathan

00:23:26.405 --> 00:23:28.532
Hey, Mob. Wait...

00:23:28.741 --> 00:23:29.825
Listen to me!

00:23:30.034 --> 00:23:33.412
There's something... I need to tell you!

00:23:33.621 --> 00:23:36.874
